From 95eef5c105cbd758ad620521961c141e901ffa59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:05:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: expose typed network seed discovery and anchor
 lifecycle

Convert eight Info consumers describing DNS completion, skipped discovery,
reactivation waits, fixed-seed fallback and block-relay anchors. Three count
consumers use the existing unsigned Count field. Static transitions carry event
names without invented numeric data. Preserve every message, Info severity,
ALL category and seed/address/anchor control flow; no new address disclosure.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py0.51.0; reviewed catalog committed here):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/network-seed-discovery.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/network-seed-applied.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/net.cpp

Validation:15 converter fixtures including every reviewed catalog, exact text,
severity/category and duplicate call count pass. Idempotence after formatting
has empty diff; source event lint31 passes; git diff --check clean. Native net
syntax/full Logger and live producer coverage pending. No network suite or
benchmarks launched. Tier:shared eCash; V2 inherits.

